	(text "ESP32-S3 CARRIER BOARD  -  rev 1.1  -  2026-10-22"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cb554df3-46d6-4288-a390-59f29d02f62f")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n1) Every module plugs into 2.54 mm female header sockets. Pin names are printed next to each socket on the silkscreen.\n2) Power: DevKit 5V pin -> +5V. SW7 (slide) drives Q3 (P-MOSFET) with a soft-start (R16 100k + C16 100nF, ~20 ms ramp): +5V -> +5V_MOD.\n   +5V_MOD -> microSD, RDM6300, IR LEDs, buzzer and U2 (AMS1117-3.3) -> +3V3_MOD (all 3.3 V modules).\n   SW7 OFF: the ESP32 keeps running, every module is unpowered. The ESP32's own 3V3 pin is not used (no overload / brown-out).\n3) Shared SPI: MOSI=IO11 SCK=IO12 MISO=IO13. CS: CC1101=IO10, SD=IO14, NRF1 CSN=IO5, NRF2 CSN=IO7 (10k pull-ups R12-R15).\n   CE: NRF1=IO4, NRF2=IO6. CC1101 GDO0=IO9, GDO2=IO42. NRF IRQ: NRF1=IO21, NRF2=IO48 (optional, can be ignored by firmware).\n4) Shared I2C: SDA=IO8 SCL=IO18, 4.7k pull-ups to +3V3_MOD (R1, R2). Devices: OLED SH1106 (0x3C), PN532 (0x24), Si5351 (0x60).\n   PN532 V3 DIP switch: SW1=ON SW2=OFF for I2C.\n5) RDM6300 TX is 5 V logic -> R8/R9 divider (~3.4 V) -> IO17. The 125 kHz coil plugs into J8.\n6) IR receiver VS1838B on IO1 (R11/C11 supply filter, lens faces the top edge). IR transmitter on IO2: Q1 + 220R base,\n   three IR LEDs, each with its own 47R resistor (~67 mA each), C15 local reservoir. Drive IO2 only with the 38 kHz carrier,\n   never hold it high. Buzzer on IO47 (Q2 + 1N4148).\n7) Buttons pull to GND (enable internal pull-ups): UP=IO15 DOWN=IO16 LEFT=IO38 RIGHT=IO39 OK=IO40 BACK=IO41.\n   Note: on DevKitC-1 v1.1 IO38 also drives the on-board RGB LED.\n8) JP1: normally-closed solder bridge. Old Catalex modules never release MISO; if SPI devices clash, cut JP1 and tie the\n   module's 74LVC125 MISO OE pin to CS (or add a tri-state buffer here).\n9) Unused GPIO: 0, 3, 19, 20, 35-37, 45, 46, TX/RX, RST."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 320.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3fe4a9e7-b9d3-4501-ac16-eded9030e9e9")
	)
